
STM8S103F3P6 Hardware Abstraction Layer
    ==============================

This project is a custom HAL from the STM8S103F3P6 MCU.


Tools
-----

* Compilier : SDCC (Small Device C Compilier) with pedantics flags
* Build : Makefile, program ST-LINK V2, stm8sflash software
* Checker : Cppcheck with MISRA C:2012 addon
* Text Editor : Emacs
* Coding Style : Allman